2026-06-22 17:32:14,118 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: To address the client's requirements, we will need to design an AI solution that incorporates several key components. First, we should utilize our Large Language Model (LLM) expertise, specifically leveraging models like Mistral 7B Instruct, which is our preferred sovereign model due to its strong performance in French and its compliance with EU regulations. This model can be fine-tuned using methods such as LoRA or QLoRA to adapt it to the specific context of administrative tasks.

